      "createdAt": 1780743053624,
      "changelog": "- Initial release of 作业设计师 (Assignment Designer) version 1.0.0.\n- Enables teachers to upgrade from \"unified assignments\" to \"differentiated, precise assignment design\" with layered tasks and clear grading standards.\n- Integrates with lesson-planner and student-analyzer, allowing assignments to be tailored to student learning data.\n- Outputs layered assignment cards (A/B/C) based on diagnostic summaries; defaults to basic assignments when no learning profile is available.\n- Provides step-by-step grading rubrics, simplified feedback templates, and structured data write-back for continuous teaching improvement.\n- Follows a \"fewer, better, and layered\" principle, emphasizing individualized, efficient, and feedback-driven homework design.",
